    rdf:value "Funded by" .

kg:note_ref10460_scopecontent_0_p_0 a crm:E33_Linguistic_Object ;
    rdf:value "The inventory numbers noted in the sketchbooks refer to entries in the Samarra Fundjournal (No.S-1) where rough sketches accompany detailed descriptions, location of finds, etc., cross-referenced to the sketchbooks of measured drawings. In the Fundjournal, the unpublished Houses have been re-numbered. Herzfeld used \"In.\" as the abbreviation of Inventory in all his references, so that is used here." .

