    rdf:value "- Translated handwritten notes for pg. 37 and 38 reads, \"House VII, [room 1, 2, 3, 4 (courtyard), 6, 7, 8, 13 (courtyard), 9 (bath), 10, 11, 12, 14, 17] (formerly Haus V).\"" .

