    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Additional information from Diary 1 of the second campaign reads, \"Samarra, July 2, 1913 (p. 1); Samarra, December 1, 1912 (p. 3-4); ?, December 2, 1912 (p. 4); ?, December 7, 1912 (p. 4-6); ?, December 9, 1912 (p. 6-7); ?, December 13, 1912 (p. 7-9); ?, December 16, 1912 (p. 9-12); ?, December 17, 1912 (p. 12); ?, December 18, 1912 (p. 12); ?, December 19, 1912 (p. 13-14); ?, December 22, 1912 (p. 15-17); ?, December 23, 1912 (p. 18); ?, December 25, 1912 (p. 19); ?, December 27, 1912 (p. 19-20); ?, December 28, 1912 (p. 20-21); ?, January 1, 1913 (p. 21-22); ?, January 2, 1913 (p. 22); ?, January 4, 1913 (p. 22-23); ?, January 9, 1913 (p. 23-26); ?, January 15, 1913 (p. 27-29); ?, January 17, 1913 (p. 29-31); ?, January 27, 1913 (p. 31-34); ?, January 29, 1913 (p. 34-36); ?, January 31, 1913 (p. 36-37); ?, February 3, 1913 (p. 37-39); ?, February 5, 1913 (p. 40-39); ?, February 11, 1913 (p. 41-42); ?, February 19, 1913 (p. 43); ?, February 20, 1913 (p. 43-46); ?, February 20, 1913 (p. 46); ?, February 22, 1913 (p. 46); ?, February 24, 1913 (p. 46); ?, March 4, 1913 (p. 47-48); ?, March 11, 1913 (p. 49); ?, May 2, 1913 (p. 49-51); ?, May 5, 1913 (p. 51); ?, May 10, 1913 (p. 52-53); ?, May 19, 1913 (p. 54-71); ?, May 26, 1913 (p. 71-72); ?, May 27, 1913 (p. 72); ?, May 28, 1913 (p. 72); ?, May 30, 1913 (p. 73-74); ?, June 03, 1913 (p. 74-75); ?, June 04, 1913 (p. 75-76); ?, June 13, 1913 (p. 76-87); ?, June 14, 1913 (p. 87); ?, June 16, 1913 (p. 88-95); ?, June 17, 1913 (p. 95-97); ?, June 19, 1913 (p. 98-101); ?, June 20, 1913 (p. 102-104); ?, June 28, 1913 (p. 105-109); ?, June 30, 1913 (p. 109-111); ?, July 06, 1913 (p. 111-112)." ;
