    rdf:value "Scope and Contents - Original caption for item 'a' (top left) reads, \"Gebaüde X.\" Translated caption for item 'a' reads, \"Building X.\" Decorative motifs are specified in room 2, and room 3." ;
    mbs:noteType mbs:ScopeContent .

