        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'n' reads, \"IN-268: khirr Gzêïgi.\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'o' reads, \"IN-220: [House XIII, room 12 (formerly Haus IX, zimmer 12)]; IN-211: [Bath II, (Bad II)]; IN-222: [House XII, bath, room 10 (formerly Haus IX, bad, zimmer 10)]; IN-227: [House XII, room 20 (formerly Haus IX, zimmer 20)]; IN-689: [Tall al-Alīq (Tell al-Alidj)]; IN-691: [Dār al-Khilāfa, Small Serdab].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'p' reads, \"IN-129: [House II, west and east room (formerly Haus I, west and ost zimmer)]; IN-621: [Dār al-Khilāfa, 11 and 16]; IN-620: [Dār al-Khilāfa, 16t, 31q]; IN-681: [Dār al-Khilāfa, 31s].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'q' reads, \"IN-656: [Dār al-Khilāfa, 33l].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'r' reads, \"IN-656: [Dār al-Khilāfa, 33l]; IN-977: [Dār al-Khilāfa, Throne Hall (Thronsäle)].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 's' reads, \"[room 6].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 't' reads, \"[House IX, room 7 (Haus IX, zimmer 7)]; [House XIV, room 8 (Haus II, zimmer 8)].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'u' reads, \"[House V, room 37, 45 ( Haus V, zimmer 37, 45)]; [House II, room 8 (Haus II, zimmer 8)].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'v' reads, \"[House II, room 8 (Haus II, zimmer 8)].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'w' reads, \"IN-109: [House II, room 13 ([formerly] Haus I, zimmer 13)]; IN-103: [House IV ([formerly] Haus III)]; IN-102: [House VII].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Translated handwritten notes for item 'x' reads, \"[IN-215: House XIV, T-shaped Hall (Haus VIII, T-form)].\"",
