kg:physical_ref10455 a crm:E22_Human_Made_Object,
        mbs:DocumentaryFile,
        mbs:PhysicalComponent ;
    rdfs:label "S-7: \"Samarra, Tagebuch 2. Reise nach Sulaimaniyyah und nach Ktesiphon-Baghdad. Ernst Herzfeld\". First pages are bibliographical notes on proposed trip. Trip began (p.6) June 2, 1911; he arrived at Paikuli via Khaniqin June 17th; back in Kerkuk June 24th and Imam Dur June 29th. Pp.51--53 draft of reply to Strzygowski's review of \"Die Genesis der islamischen Kunst...\" Pp.58--62 notes on Gertrude Bell's Amurath; pp.63--95 account of round-trip Samarra to Baghdad-Ktesiphon, September 12th- October 8th, 1911;pp. 96--98 \"Desiderata in Aleppo.\" [1911]" ;
    crm:P2_has_type aat:300027182,
