    crm:P3_has_note "Arrangement - Journals, letters, and sketchbooks are arranged roughly in sequential number sequences, housed in document boxes.",
        "Arrangement - S-30 is organized into 17 subdivisions which include one or several items of original materials.",
        "Date/Time and Place of an Event Note Notes related primarly to the two campaigns of excavation at Sāmarrāʼ (Iraq), carried out by Ernst Herzfeld on behalf of the Kaiser Friedrich Museum in Berlin between the years 1911 and 1913.",
        "Existence and Location of Copies - Illustration numbered Abb. 125. Orn. 127; reproduced in \"Herzfeld, Ernst, 1923: Der Wandschmuck der Bauten von Samarra und seine Ornamentik. Berlin, D. Reimer. p.88, abb. 125.\"",
        "Existence and Location of Copies - Illustration numbered Abb. 28. Orn. 22; reproduced in \"Herzfeld, Ernst, 1923: Der Wandschmuck der Bauten von Samarra und seine Ornamentik. Berlin, D. Reimer. p.29, abb. 28.\"",
        "Existence and Location of Copies - Illustration numbered Abb. 36. Orn. 30; reproduced in \"Herzfeld, Ernst, 1923: Der Wandschmuck der Bauten von Samarra und seine Ornamentik. Berlin, D. Reimer. p.33, abb. 36.\"",
        "Existence and Location of Copies - Illustration numbered Abb. 62. Orn. 49; reproduced in \"Herzfeld, Ernst, 1923: Der Wandschmuck der Bauten von Samarra und seine Ornamentik. Berlin, D. Reimer. p.45, abb. 62.\"",
        "Funding note Funded by",
        "General - Series title in Joseph Upton's Catalogue of the Herzfeld Archive reads, \"Records of Samarra Expeditions.\"",
        "General - Since these are primary sources, handwritten captions in the sketchbook are specified in three stages: (1) an English designation following Thomas Leisten and Alastair Northedge's terminology; (2) the transcribed original caption in German which is provided under parenthesis; and (3) additonal information from Herzfeld's publication, \"Der Wandschmuck der Bauten von Samarra und Seine Ornamentik. Verlag Dietrich Reimer, Ernst Vohsen, Berlin, 1923,\" which is provided under bracket.",
        "General - Title is provided by Xavier Courouble, FSg Archives cataloger, based on Joseph Upton's Catalogue of the Herzfeld Archive.",
        "Local Numbers S-30 FSA A.06 07.30.03",
        "Scope and Contents - Additional information for item 'a' (top left) reads, \"[Dār al-Khilāfa, Ḥarem, ornament 49 and 56].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Additional information for item 'b' (top right) reads, \"[IN-920: [Dār al-Khilāfa].\"",
        "Scope and Contents - Additional information for item 'c' (bottom left) reads, \"[IN-36; IN-38; IN-59; IN-627: Dār al-Khilāfa, 35n; IN-732: Dār al-Khilāfa, 26w.\"]",
        "Scope and Contents - Additional information for item 'd' (bottom right) reads, \"[IN-884: Dār al-Khilāfa, ornament 30.\"]" ;
